Subject: [PATCH 15/37] Cloud patch 0016-subscription-data-flow, ported at head

A queue_consume edge grounds either way round, in schema (groundingEdgeKeys) and in head's
liftedEdgeKeys, including the rolled-up module and service keys. New analyzer test: 3 cases,
the topic -> subscriber case fails without the askTools change.
